| `shell.test_runner` | string | `bats` | an adapter name `scripts/shell_gate.py` has: `bats` | `scripts/shell_gate.py`, through `scripts/config_loader.py`'s `shell.test_runner` row | Names the runner `make test-sh` asks to count the tests and then runs; zero tests is exit 13 and a count that is not a whole number is exit 11. A name with no adapter is exit 14 before anything runs; the tool on neither the interpreter's directory nor PATH is exit 11 naming it. Absent, the targets write `[using default] shell.test_runner = "bats"` to stderr. | the linter: `shell.linter` | always |
